{"id":56081,"date":"2026-08-26T10:00:00","date_gmt":"2026-08-26T09:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=56081"},"modified":"2026-10-01T22:48:12","modified_gmt":"2026-10-01T21:48:12","slug":"mini-e-meia-maratona-abrantes","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/mini-e-meia-maratona-abrantes\/","title":{"rendered":"Mini e Meia Maratona Abrantes 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Mini e Meia Maratona Abrantes 2026<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Mini e Meia Maratona Abrantes 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>8 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partidas e chegadas no <strong>TagusValley \u2013 Parque de Ci\u00eancia e Tecnologia<\/strong>, na cidade de <strong>Abrantes<\/strong>, distrito de <strong>Santar\u00e9m<\/strong>. Com percursos urbanos certificados pela Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo, a prova destaca-se pela excelente organiza\u00e7\u00e3o e ambiente de festa.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O programa integra a prestigiada <strong>Meia Maratona de 21 km<\/strong> (com partida \u00e0s 10:00 e pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios \u00e0 geral), a r\u00e1pida <strong>Mini Maratona de 10 km<\/strong> (10:00), a <strong>Prova Jovem<\/strong> para escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o (10:10) e a acess\u00edvel <strong>Caminhada de 8 km<\/strong> (10:15). Todos os inscritos t\u00eam direito a t-shirt t\u00e9cnica, medalh\u00e3o, banhos no Est\u00e1dio Municipal e uma tradicional refei\u00e7\u00e3o de conv\u00edvio (sopa, bifana e bebida).<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o est\u00e1 a cargo do <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Abrantes<\/strong> em estreita parceria com a <strong>Casa do Benfica em Abrantes<\/strong>, com o apoio t\u00e9cnico dos ju\u00edzes da Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Santar\u00e9m.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span cl